    <div id="mainContent">
            <p class="Division"><a name="13.12.008"></a>Division 13-12-008<br />Repair and Replacement</p>


            <p class="digCH">Sections:</p>

            <p class="CiteTOC"><a href="../Flagstaff13/Flagstaff1312008.html#13.12.008.0001">13-12-008-0001</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Repair and Replacement</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="13.12.008.0001"><a name="13.12.008.0001">13-12-008-0001</a> Repair and Replacement</h3>
            <p class="P0">If an existing streetlight installation that is not in conformance with these standards suffers an outage or damage, then either:</p>

            <p class="P1">A.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The light shall not be repaired, but rather, replaced with an installation which conforms to these standards if such an installation would be in conformance with the intersection and spacing requirements of the standards; or</p>

            <p class="P1">B.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The light shall be removed if its repair or replacement would violate the intersection and spacing requirements of the standards. (Ord. 2017-22, Rep&amp;ReEn, 07/05/2017; Ord. 2020-10, Amended, 09/15/2020 (Res. 2020-13))</p>

    </div>
